  "cited_article_id": "update-practice-settings-and-locations",
  "reply": "Changes to your practice address and Tax ID only affect new claim drafts. Verify that the correct location is linked in **Billing > Claim Defaults**; if it’s still pointing to the old address, update it there and save. After that, clear your browser cache and submit a new draft—existing claims won’t be updated retroactively."
}
